  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assist our Rehabilitation and Therapy Outreach.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Tanzania, many individuals with disabilities (PWDs) face the harsh reality of poverty. Unfortunately, health insurance companies often fail to cover essential assistive devices such as wheelchairs and vital rehabilitation services. As a result, numerous people with disabilities are confined to their beds at home, which exacerbates their poverty levels and exposes them to additional health challenges, including pressure sores, contractures, and hypostatic pneumonia.</narrative>
  </description>
